# NestJS

Follow `.cursor/skills/nestjs/SKILL.md` for framework patterns. Place files using `.cursor/skills/structure-ddd/SKILL.md`.

Hard rules:

- Feature Nest modules under `bootstrap/modules/` — no circular module imports
- Constructor injection only; bind ports via tokens in feature modules
- Controllers stay thin — map HTTP DTO → command/query → handler
- Validate at the edge (DTO + pipes); domain stays framework-free
- Test with `TestingModule` / Supertest; mock ports, not Nest internals
